- *   mode "async" (Fase 4H — the producer side of the queue)
- *     auth -> workspace -> workflow -> validate -> snapshot
- *     -> enqueueWorkflowExecution() -> 202 { executionId, status: "queued" }
- *     Nothing is executed during the request.
